# RF & Microwave PCB Design | PTFE, Sub-GHz to Ka-Band | Qmax Systems

**Meta description:** RF and microwave PCB layout on PTFE and Rogers substrates - controlled impedance routing, coplanar waveguide, stripline, Sub-GHz to Ka-band. Altium & Cadence.

